      "role": "user",
      "content": "these are a good start but a bit generic. for a classifier to be actually effective, it needs to see how these play out in specific social groupings. could you expand on this? specifically, can you give me some examples of how these microaggressions might differ depending on the race of the person being targeted—like, what are some common tropes or \"subtle\" comments that specifically target Black professionals vs. Asian professionals in a corporate setting?",
