    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's helpful for the training data. to make the classifier even more robust, i need to see if it can distinguish between actual microaggressions and just general social friction or cultural differences. can you provide a few more nuanced scenarios where it might be hard to tell? for instance, compare how a manager might perceive the same behavior (like being quiet in a meeting or being very direct) depending on the race of the employee. i want the model to see how these character traits are often racialized in professional assessments.",
